# Cacaroon's quests against each other (he has no script, so a lone event always plays): a level 75 Warrior beside him
# with Two Horn the Savage at Prog 1 (608, an Event, once per zone), Rat Race at Prog 2 (853) or Prog 3 (854), both
# Events, and Led Astray at Prog 2 (812, a Progress while its Stage bit 2 is clear; a GM clears the Stage after each
# talk), all by GMs. Four talks each: all three (812 over the Events); Led Astray off, Rat Race 853 and Two Horn 608
# alone (a tie of Events: 608 plays once per zone, then 853 or 854 alone); Rat Race at Prog 3 with Led Astray (812 over
# 854), then with Led Astray off (854 and 608).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Cacaroon/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/812
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=-70.5,0,-82.337 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.TwoHornTheSavage accepted
charvar Quest[6][17]Prog 1
quest AhtUrhgan.LedAstray accepted
charvar Quest[6][65]Prog 2
quest AhtUrhgan.RatRace accepted
charvar Quest[6][66]Prog 2
login
trigger Cacaroon                        # all three: 812 over 853 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # all three: 812 over 853 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # all three: 812 over 853 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # all three: 812 over 853 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
quest AhtUrhgan.LedAstray available       # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray off: 853: a tie with 608 (Events), rotation starts here
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray off: 608 (the tie rotates; once per zone)
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray off: 853: 608 is Ignore now
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray off: 853
finish
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi
warp -70.5,0,-82.337 AhtUrhganWhitegate  # zoned: 608 plays again
charvar Quest[6][66]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # Rat Race Prog 3, Two Horn: 854: a tie with 608 (Events), rotation starts here
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Rat Race Prog 3, Two Horn: 608 (the tie rotates; once per zone)
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Rat Race Prog 3, Two Horn: 854: 608 is Ignore now
finish
trigger Cacaroon                        # Rat Race Prog 3, Two Horn: 854
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.LedAstray accepted        # a GM
charvar Quest[6][65]Prog 2
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray Prog 2 again: 812 over 854 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray Prog 2 again: 812 over 854 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray Prog 2 again: 812 over 854 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Cacaroon                        # Led Astray Prog 2 again: 812 over 854 and 608
finish
charvar Quest[6][65]Stage 0              # a GM
